      "publishedAt": "2026-02-26T17:10:28.000Z",
      "fetchedAt": "2026-03-08T15:11:45.441Z",
      "fullText": "Today&#8217;s issue of The Pulse focuses on a single event because it&#8217;s a significant one with major potential ripple effects. On Tuesday, Cloudflare shocked the dev world by announcing that they have rewritten Next.js in just one week, with a single developer who used only $1,100 in tokens: Cloudflare CTO Dane Knecht on X There are several layers to dig into h&#8230; Read more",
