      "title": "Americans trust Fauci over RFK Jr. and career scientists over Trump officials",
      "url": "https://arstechnica.com/health/2026/03/americans-trust-fauci-over-rfk-jr-and-career-scientists-over-trump-officials/",
      "topic": "Technology",
